WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.678 --> 00:00:05.633
THAT PROBABLY IF I HAD TO BET

00:00:05.644 --> 00:00:07.479
WON’T BE COMING.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.262
HERE WITH MORE WENDY RITTENHOUSE

00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:10.589
IS WITH US.

00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:13.934
I AM SURE THIS IS A HARD TIME

00:00:13.945 --> 00:00:16.292
FOR YOU AND YOUR FAMILY.

00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:18.113
I WANT TO TAKE THIS AUDIENCE

00:00:18.114 --> 00:00:20.814
BACK TO YESTERDAY WHEN YOUR SON

00:00:20.815 --> 00:00:22.969
WAS TESTING AND HE HAD A TOUGH

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:23.874
TIME.

00:00:23.885 --> 00:00:26.104
LET’S PLAY THIS.

00:00:26.137 --> 00:00:31.719
&gt;&gt; I WAS CORNERED IN FRONT OF ME

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.631
WITH MR. ZIMINSKI.

00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:41.013
AND THERE WERE --

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:43.278
[VOICE BREAKING].

00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:45.325
[SOBBING].

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:54.499
THERE WERE PEOPLE --

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.102
[SOBBING].

00:00:58.103 --> 00:01:05.398
[VOICE BREAKING].

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:08.351
[SOBBING]

00:01:08.362 --> 00:01:10.514
[SOBBING].

00:01:10.525 --> 00:01:11.195
[INAUDIBLE].

00:01:11.228 --> 00:01:14.405
&gt;&gt; WE WILL TAKE A BREAK.

00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:16.425
&gt;&gt; Sean: I WATCHED THAT.

00:01:16.436 --> 00:01:18.233
I READ PEOPLE PRETTY WELL.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.674
DONE IT MY WHOLE LIFE.

00:01:20.685 --> 00:01:23.014
THAT SEEMED LIKE A CLASSIC PANIC

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:24.726
ATTACK THAT WE WERE WITNESSING

00:01:24.737 --> 00:01:25.636
ON THE STAND.

00:01:25.637 --> 00:01:29.014
THAT’S YOUR SON.

00:01:29.016 --> 00:01:34.198
HOW DOES THAT MAKE YOU FEEL?

00:01:34.199 --> 00:01:36.243
&gt;&gt; [SILENCE].

00:01:36.244 --> 00:01:41.228
I JUST BREAKDOWN WITH KYLE

00:01:41.239 --> 00:01:43.290
CRYING LIKE THAT.

00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:45.951
IT MADE ME FEEL HEART BROKEN AND

00:01:45.985 --> 00:01:46.265
SAD.

00:01:46.276 --> 00:01:49.690
I WANTED TO JUST GO UP THERE AND

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:54.641
HUG HIM AND TELL HIM IT WOULD BE

00:01:54.674 --> 00:01:55.383
OKAY.

00:01:55.394 --> 00:01:57.590
&gt;&gt; WHEN THE CANDIDATE FOR THE

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:59.125
PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES

00:01:59.159 --> 00:02:00.613
AND OTHER ELECTED OFFICIALS THAT

00:02:00.624 --> 00:02:02.967
DON’T KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT YOUR

00:02:02.978 --> 00:02:05.579
SON REFER TO HIM AS A WHITE

00:02:05.613 --> 00:02:08.202
SUPREMACIST, I HAVE YET TO SEE

00:02:08.203 --> 00:02:10.284
ANY EVIDENCE THAT HE IS SUCH

00:02:10.285 --> 00:02:11.822
A PERSON.

00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:15.190
WHEN PROMINENT PEOPLE SAY THAT,

00:02:15.224 --> 00:02:23.835
HOW DID THAT IMPACT YOU AND
IMPACT HIM?

00:02:23.846 --> 00:02:24.918
IMPACT HIM?

00:02:24.929 --> 00:02:32.505
&gt;&gt; WHEN I SAW, AFTERWARDS OF THE

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.321
PRESIDENTIAL DEBATE.

00:02:34.332 --> 00:02:36.596
I WAS IN SHOCK.

00:02:36.607 --> 00:02:38.736
I WAS ANGRY.

00:02:38.747 --> 00:02:42.368
PRESIDENT BIDEN DON’T KNOW MY

00:02:42.369 --> 00:02:43.099
SON.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:43.724
WHATSOEVER.

00:02:43.726 --> 00:02:49.655
HE IS NOT A WHITE SUPREMACIST.

00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:52.557
HE IS NOT A RACIST.

00:02:52.568 --> 00:02:55.114
HE DID THAT FOR THE VOTES.

00:02:55.148 --> 00:02:58.715
I WAS SO ANGRY FOR A WHILE AT

00:02:58.726 --> 00:03:03.605
HIM AND WHAT HE DID TO MY SON.

00:03:03.639 --> 00:03:04.907
HE DEFAMED HIM.

00:03:04.908 --> 00:03:07.266
&gt;&gt; Sean: LET’S GO BACK TO THAT

00:03:07.277 --> 00:03:10.243
NIGHT AND ROLL THIS VIDEOTAPE

00:03:10.277 --> 00:03:13.060
PUT TOGETHER BY YOUR SON’S

00:03:13.071 --> 00:03:14.191
FORMER ATTORNEY.

00:03:14.202 --> 00:03:16.657
YOU SEE YOUR SON RUNNING AND

00:03:16.668 --> 00:03:18.292
A CROWD OF PEOPLE RACING TO

00:03:18.326 --> 00:03:19.464
CATCH UP TO HIM.

00:03:19.475 --> 00:03:20.485
THE FIRST OPINION KNOCKS OFF HIS

00:03:20.519 --> 00:03:21.285
HAT.

00:03:21.286 --> 00:03:24.691
HE IS ON THE GROUND WANT THEN

00:03:24.692 --> 00:03:26.928
THIS PICTURE OF AN INDIVIDUAL

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:29.622
WITH HIS LEG UP ABOUT TO POUND

00:03:29.633 --> 00:03:31.191
HIS LEG INTO HIS FACE INTO THE

00:03:31.202 --> 00:03:32.003
CEMENT.

00:03:32.014 --> 00:03:36.385
THAT WAS ONE OF THE SHOOTINGS.

00:03:36.396 --> 00:03:39.123
WHAT DO YOU SEE THERE?

00:03:39.134 --> 00:03:41.996
&gt;&gt; I SEE THIS MAN TRYING TO KICK

00:03:42.031 --> 00:03:44.694
MY SON IN THE FACE.

00:03:44.695 --> 00:03:45.917
I WAS SCARED.

00:03:45.918 --> 00:03:47.821
I WAS FRIGHTENED.

00:03:47.832 --> 00:03:51.320
I THOUGHT MY SON WAS GOING TO

00:03:51.354 --> 00:03:52.714
DIE THAT NIGHT.

00:03:52.715 --> 00:03:56.284
&gt;&gt; Sean: WHEN YOU SEE THE TAPE

00:03:56.295 --> 00:03:58.219
AND YOU HEARD WITNESSES TESTIFY

00:03:58.254 --> 00:04:00.589
THAT HE WAS TRYING TO DEESCALATE

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.548
THE SITUATION THERE, WHEN YOU

00:04:02.582 --> 00:04:04.878
LOOK AT THE TAPE AND THE WITNESS

00:04:04.889 --> 00:04:06.229
TESTIMONY AND THEN THE

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:08.456
PROSECUTION BRINGS ON THEIR STAR

00:04:08.489 --> 00:04:09.952
WITNESS WHO GOT SHOT BY YOUR

00:04:09.963 --> 00:04:10.941
SON.

00:04:10.975 --> 00:04:13.891
THAT STAR WITNESS ADMITTED ON

00:04:13.902 --> 00:04:18.478
THE STAND UNDER OATH HE AIMED

00:04:18.489 --> 00:04:23.674
A LOADED GUN AT YOUR SON BEFORE

00:04:23.685 --> 00:04:25.666
YOUR SON SHOT HIM.

00:04:25.677 --> 00:04:27.661
THAT SEEMS LIKE A CLASSIC CASE

00:04:27.672 --> 00:04:28.360
OF SELF-DEFENSE.

00:04:28.394 --> 00:04:29.243
YOUR THOUGHTS?

00:04:29.254 --> 00:04:33.318
&gt;&gt; WHEN I LOOK AT THE VIDEO WITH

00:04:33.329 --> 00:04:36.164
THAT GUY POINTING THE GUN TO MY

00:04:36.165 --> 00:04:39.966
SON’S HEAD, I THOUGHT HE WAS

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:46.181
GOING TO DIE.

00:04:46.192 --> 00:04:47.451
[CRYING].

00:04:47.485 --> 00:04:53.201
HE POINTED HIS GUN AT HIS HEAD.

00:04:53.212 --> 00:04:58.001
[VOICE BREAKING].
IT TOOK A LONG TIME JUST TO

00:04:58.035 --> 00:05:05.365
IT TOOK A LONG TIME JUST TO
GRASP THAT HE WAS ALIVE.

00:05:05.376 --> 00:05:07.187
GRASP THAT HE WAS ALIVE.

00:05:07.198 --> 00:05:13.574
KNOWING HE IS WITH ME, I AM

00:05:13.607 --> 00:05:14.552
GRATEFUL.

00:05:14.563 --> 00:05:19.558
I AM RELIEVED HE IS OKAY, BUT HE

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:24.648
HAS A LOT OF HEALING TO DO.

00:05:24.682 --> 00:05:28.640
BECAUSE HE DOES HAVE NIGHTMARES

00:05:28.641 --> 00:05:30.168
FROM THIS.

00:05:30.179 --> 00:05:34.444
&gt;&gt; Sean: LET ME ASK YOU ABOUT

00:05:34.478 --> 00:05:36.789
THE JUDGE WHO WHAT HAS BEEN

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:38.929
HARSH AGAINST THE PROSECUTION.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.687
THEY MAY BE OVER THE BORDER

00:05:40.698 --> 00:05:41.303
LINE.

00:05:41.337 --> 00:05:43.182
IT BETTER STOP.

00:05:43.193 --> 00:05:46.051
I WAS ASTONISHED WHEN YOU BEGAN

00:05:46.062 --> 00:05:48.057
YOUR EXAMINATION BY COMMENTING

00:05:48.068 --> 00:05:49.450
ON POST-ARREST SILENCE.

00:05:49.461 --> 00:05:51.988
THAT’S BEEN THE BASIC LAW IN

00:05:51.999 --> 00:05:54.873
THIS COUNTRY FOR 50 YEARS.

00:05:54.884 --> 00:05:57.224
DON’T GET BRAZEN WITH ME.

00:05:57.225 --> 00:05:58.875
YOU KNEW ATTORNEYS CAN’T GO INTO

00:05:58.886 --> 00:05:59.917
THESE AREAS.

00:05:59.918 --> 00:06:02.069
DO YOU THINK YOUR SON AS

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:06.103
RECEIVED A FAIR TRIAL?

00:06:06.114 --> 00:06:10.796
&gt;&gt; THE JUDGE IS VERY FAIR.

00:06:10.807 --> 00:06:16.402
PEOPLE THAT I TALK TO WHO LIVED

00:06:16.413 --> 00:06:19.483
IN KENOSHA ALL THEIR LIVES TOLD

00:06:19.516 --> 00:06:23.015
ME JUDGE SCHROEDER AND A FAIR

00:06:23.026 --> 00:06:24.966
JUDGE AND DOESN’T ALLOW NO

00:06:24.977 --> 00:06:26.329
NONSENSE IN HIS COURTROOM.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.462
&gt;&gt; Sean: NOBODY KNOWS WHAT

00:06:28.473 --> 00:06:29.837
A JURY WILL DO.

00:06:29.871 --> 00:06:32.197
I AM NOT ASKING SPECIFICALLY FOR

00:06:32.208 --> 00:06:33.238
THEIR REACTION.

00:06:33.249 --> 00:06:36.040
A SCALE OF 1 TO 10 HOW SERIOUSLY

00:06:36.051 --> 00:06:38.609
DO YOU BELIEVE THEY ARE TAKING

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.115
THIS CASE BECAUSE THEY HOLD YOUR

00:06:40.148 --> 00:06:42.060
SON’S LIFE IN YOUR HANDS?

00:06:42.071 --> 00:06:44.453
&gt;&gt; YES, THEY DO.

00:06:44.487 --> 00:06:47.127
THE JURY HAVE BEEN KEEPING

00:06:47.128 --> 00:06:49.239
A CLOSE EYE ON EVERY EVIDENCE

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:52.487
AND EVERY TESTIMONY.

00:06:52.488 --> 00:06:55.379
THEY ARE PAYING GOOD ATTENTION

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.189
WHAT IS SAID THAT IS THE TRUTH.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.065
&gt;&gt; Sean: THIS LAST QUESTION.

00:07:00.066 --> 00:07:03.276
YOUR SON WAS A LIFEGUARD AND

00:07:03.287 --> 00:07:06.326
STATED REASON WAS TO HELP

00:07:06.337 --> 00:07:09.219
PROTECT STORES AND HELP ON THE

00:07:09.253 --> 00:07:10.196
MEDICAL FRONT.

00:07:10.207 --> 00:07:12.134
HAVE YOU AND YOUR SON DISCUSSED

00:07:12.145 --> 00:07:14.612
WHETHER OR NOT IF HE HAD TO DO

00:07:14.623 --> 00:07:17.558
IT OVER AGAIN HE WOULD GO INTO

00:07:17.569 --> 00:07:19.564
A SITUATION LIKE THAT?

00:07:19.575 --> 00:07:21.479
&gt;&gt; WITH KYLE, I KNOW HIM.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:23.906
HE WOULD PROBABLY DO IT AGAIN.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:27.626
THAT’S THE TYPE OF PERSON HE IS.

00:07:27.637 --> 00:07:29.911
HE ALWAYS WANTS TO HELP PEOPLE.

00:07:29.922 --> 00:07:32.180
EVEN SINCE HE WAS A LITTLE BOY,

00:07:32.191 --> 00:07:33.581
ALL HE WANTED TO DO WAS HELP

00:07:33.592 --> 00:07:34.098
PEOPLE.

00:07:34.109 --> 00:07:37.723
IT DIDN’T MATTER IF IT WAS

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:39.710
RAKING LEAVES FOR THE NORTH

00:07:39.721 --> 00:07:42.067
CAROLINAS OR TALKING TO THEM OR

00:07:42.078 --> 00:07:44.049
JUST BEING GOOFY.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.685
THAT’S HOW I RAISED HIM IS TO

00:07:46.696 --> 00:07:47.669
HELP PEOPLE.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.891
&gt;&gt; Sean: WENDY, I LEARNED IN 33

00:07:50.926 --> 00:07:52.796
YEARS OF BROADCASTING NOT TO

00:07:52.797 --> 00:07:54.738
PREDICT A JURY OUTCOME.

00:07:54.749 --> 00:07:57.042
I THINK THE PROSECUTION PUT ON

